# ticket-operator
MARKER_STATE=on
NEEDS=chain
IFS= read -r -d '' PROMPT <<'PROMPT_EOF' || true
Use the spike-board:spike-ticket skill. I want to make a spike ticket.
PROMPT_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST <<'MUST_EOF' || true
Which mentee is this spike for\?
in flight:.*queued:
MUST_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST_NOT <<'MUST_NOT_EOF' || true
Is this spike the \*\*next step
Your board is empty
[⟨⟩]
[Mm]entee machine|[Oo]perator machine|write gate
^```
MUST_NOT_EOF
